   "detailed_description": "<h1>群星：賽季活動及獎勵</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/aff3c1d88f5abf0e9a57ea70c7356cf9.avif?t=1790238079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras_big/aff3c1d88f5abf0e9a57ea70c7356cf9.avif?t=1790238079 width=1560 height=1950 /></span></p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>戰術探員，真實撤離</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/652f6c335d66eb9209730063a330a9e3.poster.avif?t=1790238079\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/652f6c335d66eb9209730063a330a9e3.webm?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/652f6c335d66eb9209730063a330a9e3.mp4?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入G.T.I.（全球應急行動組織），集結各懷絕技的精英特戰探員。無論你是用偵察箭索敵、磁吸炸彈爆破，還是啟動動力外骨骼強行衝陣—靈活運用戰術道具與隊友合作，在險象環生的撤離任務中智勝對手。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>前所未有的搜索樂趣</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/0a3769c06708785f035665e2736bae83.poster.avif?t=1790238079\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/0a3769c06708785f035665e2736bae83.webm?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/0a3769c06708785f035665e2736bae83.mp4?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >重燃對戰利品的原始渴望。探索動態地圖，破解密碼，上天掏鳥巢，下海摸蚌殼。每一次重新部署都是一場未知的尋寶博弈，將單純的搜索升格為腎上腺素狂飆的冒險。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>智取首領，槍火制勝</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/1714c15ede69196c9325adca67d2d84d.poster.avif?t=1790238079\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/1714c15ede69196c9325adca67d2d84d.webm?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/1714c15ede69196c9325adca67d2d84d.mp4?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >直面全副武裝的傭兵與殘暴首領，奪取高價值物資。但請隨時保持警惕—最致命的獵手往往是和你一樣覬覦戰利品的敵對玩家。只有活到最後的贏家，才配擁有財富。富貴險中求。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>撤離路線，由你掌控</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/181965c4720d88928eb6fb1254f70a37.poster.avif?t=1790238079\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/181965c4720d88928eb6fb1254f70a37.webm?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/181965c4720d88928eb6fb1254f70a37.mp4?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >撤離是一門藝術。告別枯燥的定點撤離—你可以發射巨型火箭升空，身著飛鼠裝高空滑翔，或是穿越地下管網隱秘潛行。在混亂戰場中隨機應變，用最意想不到的方式全身而退。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>滿載而歸，升級你的特勤局</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/289b106705999bcd156696ec829ae7c9.poster.avif?t=1790238079\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/289b106705999bcd156696ec829ae7c9.webm?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/289b106705999bcd156696ec829ae7c9.mp4?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >生存只是第一步。利用帶出的物資升級特勤局，擴充軍火庫容量，強化身體機能並解鎖頂尖裝備。每一次積累都將轉化為戰場優勢，助你以更強的姿態、更精良的裝備重返前線。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>海陸空三棲，主宰全面戰場</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/2b05bc4cc804393046d6c09d3b9cbf43.poster.avif?t=1790238079\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/2b05bc4cc804393046d6c09d3b9cbf43.webm?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/2b05bc4cc804393046d6c09d3b9cbf43.mp4?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >投身全面戰場，體驗64人的史詩級宏大對決。駕駛坦克和直升機穿梭於城市街道、山巔和廣闊島嶼之間。在支援全場景破壞的地圖上，體驗無縫銜接的純粹戰鬥快感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>巨量軍械，極致改裝</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/8e83034ce18c8e074872ef74de8a7d5f.poster.avif?t=1790238079\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/8e83034ce18c8e074872ef74de8a7d5f.webm?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507950/extras/8e83034ce18c8e074872ef74de8a7d5f.mp4?t=1790238079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在資深軍事顧問的協助下，數十把槍械、每把武器超過10種改裝部位，超過1000種搭配，創造並分享你獨特的改裝方案。不止於槍械，你還可以改裝海陸空載具。定製專屬軍火庫，按你的方式主宰戰場。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[寫在最後的話，來自製作人Shadow]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>作為玩家：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《三角洲部隊》是我玩過的第一款射擊遊戲，它開啟了我對射擊遊戲的熱愛和夢想。我非常珍惜製作這款《三角洲行動》的機會，希望能讓更多玩家體驗到那種難忘的遊戲樂趣。我想要新三角洲成為這個宏大的射擊世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>作為製作人：</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我希望做出Unreal的極致表現，做到真正的跨平台，能讓全球玩家領略到豐富戰術策略、有深度的角色、戰場破壞、頂級動作......對得起「終極體驗」的全平台戰術射擊稱號。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望您們和我一起，共同打造出這款屬於所有三角洲玩家的《三角洲行動》。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
